&lt;li&gt;Assist with preparation of revenue reporting schedules and supporting information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate routine revenue accounting issues and escalate complex matters where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Global Revenue Controller in the delivery of revenue accounting, governance and financial control objectives, and share knowledge and good practice with peers.&lt;/li&gt;
